claim.claim-text:
an input (28) configured to communicate with the passenger-detector (18);
an output (30) configured to communicate with the vehicle-controls (26) of the host-vehicle (12);
a processor (34) in communication with the passenger-detector (18) and vehicle-controls (26) of the host-vehicle (12), said processor (34) configured to operate the host-vehicle (12) in the autonomous-mode (14) and in accordance with the parameter (40).

determining (105), using a passenger-detector (18), a passenger-count (20) of passengers (22) present in a host-vehicle (12);
setting (115, 120) a parameter (40) used for operating the host-vehicle (12) in an autonomous-mode (14) to an empty-value (46) in response to a determination that the passenger-count (20) is equal to zero, wherein the empty-value (46) parameter (40) is different from an occupied-value (48) that is used in response to a determination that the passenger-count (20) is the passenger (22) count is greater than zero.; and
operating (160), using a controller-circuit (32), the host-vehicle (12) in the autonomous-mode (14) and in accordance with the parameter (40), wherein the parameter (40) is an acceleration-rate (42) of the host-vehicle (12).
